ACDT — Full Lifecycle Runbook (updated 2026-08-29)

⚠ IMPORTANT: the droplet at 204.48.26.161 referenced below was DESTROYED and
rebuilt once already. Current droplet: ubuntu-s-4vcpu-8gb-nyc1 (4 vCPU/8GB,
NYC1 region) — but IF YOU HAVE DESTROYED IT AGAIN since this doc was last
edited, the IP below is stale. Check the DigitalOcean control panel for the
current IP before following any step here that references an IP directly.

This reflects the current production setup: the backend runs on the
